{"name":"The Foldseat Bell","slug":"glyph-foldseat-bell","blurb":"On the palindrome street, Kit carries the bell toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Foldseat. Click the bell and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Foldseat Bell.","seal":"d1275c26a6ea3492f21741e954684e1c584ecabee1dcd1bf10368220db0fbb14"}
